text = "
> 
> USER ADVISORY:
> In rare cases, users have reported HALLUCINATORY OVERLAYS present in source memory
> HALLUCINATORY OVERLAYS are due to a fault with the subject's memory and are to be ignored
>
> INTERFACE CONTROLS:
> Use W A S D to navigate reconstructed spaces // Use E to engage with objects
> Use SPACE to advance dialogue // Use ESC to access the pause menu
>
> PLEASE NOTE: 
> Movement controls ARE NOT relative to the camera's direction, but the subject's
>
> SYSTEM INDICATORS:
> Objects will PING when interaction is possible
> Objects with a faint blue pulse may be collacted to unlock additional Database entries
> The Database can be used to learn more information about the subject and surroundings
> The Database can be accessed via active server terminals found within reconstruction
>
> Press ENTER to begin playback...
>
"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_esjad")
